OL,3,GNEWSAStar Wars actor surprises film
OL,4,Afestival organisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilm festival organisers say they were
OL,7,Fleft "really surprised" after Star Wars
OL,8,FDaisy Ridley agreed to join their
OL,9,Fjudging panel.
OL,11,FThe 34-year-old - best known for
OL,12,Fplaying Rey in the sci-fi franchise -
OL,13,Fagreed "almost straight away" to get
OL,14,Finvolved with Worcester Film Festival,
OL,15,Fsaid its co-founder Henrik Harms.
OL,17,FThe festival takes place at the Odeon
OL,18,Fcinema in Foregate Street from 22 to 26
OL,19,FSeptember, showcasing more than 250
OL,20,Ffilms across five days.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
